{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0267_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_03_title", "source_sha256": "ac17ccbfc6a7ee483c9c5bd57b65bb5a0ccf704be9d6f33958d61df2b76424a0", "ja": "重ね合う日々", "zh": "重叠相伴的岁月", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0267_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_03_synopsis", "source_sha256": "b525e6603931592ed1de03ef62edd1ee3e5451a5767a18e7dedc85d0e4a98307", "ja": "ハードなレッスンの後、レモンの蜂蜜漬けを\n作ってきたと言う昴。すると、響、紗代子、\n美奈子と次々に、差し入れを持って来たと言\nい出す。全部食べようと勢いづく一同に、プ\nロデューサーは内心ちょっと心配。", "zh": "昴说，在辛苦的课程之后，她做了腌蜂蜜柠檬带来。紧接着，响、纱代子、美奈子也一个接一个地说自己带来了慰问品。众人兴致勃勃地打算把这些全部吃掉，制作人却在心里有些担心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0267_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_03_1000_p", "source_sha256": "b9b1508483fd08408e9363b2f9c89f9c29d8861be1b4897b2b66786c66bf1ce9", "ja": "（基礎レッスンにボイトレ、ダンスレッスン……。\n今日は結構、重なってしまった。みんな大丈夫かな？）", "zh": "（基础训练、声乐训练、舞蹈训练……今天的安排撞在一起了不少。大家没事吧？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0267_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_03_1001_013hib", "source_sha256": "e76266f6640c2221da5219903ce93769254bf859a9e54f94b7309996122367ef", "ja": "はぁ、はぁ……！　ふぅ～、なかなかハードだったぞ。\nでも、それだけ充実感があるよね！", "zh": "呼……呼……！呼，真是相当累人啊。\n不过，也正因为这样，才会有满满的充实感呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0267_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_03_1002_027say", "source_sha256": "f607c54ee237dcfa6b73c65cac53ba63660ed885d2dc94cefe38e895702b8031", "ja": "うんうん、みんなでやり切った！\n清々しい気持ちだよね……あ、そうだ。", "zh": "嗯嗯，大家一起坚持到最后了！\n感觉真痛快呢……啊，对了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0267_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_03_1003_013hib", "source_sha256": "a28fc20c4908da2b3fc4856cf3ce13704beed8180c2948430f6b76c8118475b2", "ja": "ところで！", "zh": "话说回来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0267_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_03_1004_027say", "source_sha256": "a28fc20c4908da2b3fc4856cf3ce13704beed8180c2948430f6b76c8118475b2", "ja": "ところで！", "zh": "话说回来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0267_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_03_1005_013hib", "source_sha256": "6298726c112c046cca126e97973e9b761b6b1c37059df94723c60a6f8c85e3a9", "ja": "……っ、あはは、思いっきり被っちゃったぞ！\n紗代子からどうぞ！", "zh": "……啊哈哈，完全撞上了呢！\n纱代子先请吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0267_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_03_1006_027say", "source_sha256": "505d0e201968602d1114da2458334b89924658f59a3976fec12f0981967748f4", "ja": "ごめんごめん、響さんからどうぞ！", "zh": "对不起对不起，响，你先说！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0267_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_03_1007_013hib", "source_sha256": "4af94f1b2b1d2933e09b35db17b82405153be69147b0fd3c706d4a49c612d85b", "ja": "いやいやいや、紗代子から……。", "zh": "不不不，让纱代子先来……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0267_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_03_1008_047sub", "source_sha256": "76fbdc1a104b701a36aa6eb370712a1595fab992a2d83959501baeeb8052a3e9", "ja": "何やってんだ？　ふたりとも……あ、そーだ。\nレモンの蜂蜜漬け作ってきたから、みんなで食おうぜ♪", "zh": "你们俩在干什么呢……啊，对了。\n我做了蜂蜜腌柠檬，大家一起吃吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0267_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_03_1011_019min", "source_sha256": "ca4147ab839c6ed20f1695766a9185bb5c4692beb5e05d9b568e10f1a786fc23", "ja": "わっほ～い！　私も杏仁豆腐持ってきたから、\n一緒に食べましょう！　カロリー補給♪", "zh": "哇——！我也带了杏仁豆腐来，\n大家一起吃吧！补充热量♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0267_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_03_1012_p", "source_sha256": "5f1365745a68523320ce21e8762bce81e6cc1e9a7f4dc17961604ddfaf324b6e", "ja": "……？\n響と紗代子は、どうしたんだ？", "zh": "……？\n响和纱代子，怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0267_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_03_1013_013hib", "source_sha256": "05f55979cd96d83668b8e30a2c7377d5d51caa97142e57aa17c62af1e673fb27", "ja": "えっとね……えへへ。実は……\n自分もサーターアンダギー持ってきたんだ。", "zh": "那个……嘿嘿。其实……\n我也带了萨塔安达吉来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0267_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_03_1014_027say", "source_sha256": "2135ca0d5ad74ee66523ddec9e6c5c976946c36f8e54d23a15c70924817b8960", "ja": "え、響さんも？　私も、お菓子の\nバラエティパックを買ってきたんですよね……。", "zh": "诶，响也带了？我也买了一包什锦点心……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0267_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_03_1015_027say", "source_sha256": "453b5390d035b5b4c4e48e1bacd5f507989b6994a161be1d7b0aadf591bc3b29", "ja": "全部食べたら、さすがに多すぎますよね！？\n私のお菓子は、次の機会に……。", "zh": "全部吃完的话，果然还是太多了吧！？\n我的零食就留到下次……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0267_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_03_1016_019min", "source_sha256": "34f9a821cdf28b62f94e21d82475e70c3e2c3c5ed6d5f5a48c5c6f5e04bb0fce", "ja": "大丈夫だよ紗代子ちゃん！　レッスン中なんだし。\n残さずぜーんぶ、頂きましょうっ！　ねっ♪", "zh": "没事的啦纱代子！反正正在练习嘛。\n一口不剩，全都吃光光吧！好不好♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0267_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_03_1017_027say", "source_sha256": "7c172934d586e5cae241736158219e6217dc4cc333fd33daa56b7711531a02de", "ja": "美奈子さん……うん、そうですね！\n食べた分、レッスンすればいいんだもん。", "zh": "美奈子……嗯，说得对！\n把吃下去的分量通过练习消耗掉就好了嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0267_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_03_1018_047sub", "source_sha256": "3fa7d0ffcf3a79222c182b13a57d367166117cebc8b771bc0f567494aaaf36ce", "ja": "にしても……みんな一緒にお菓子の差し入れとか、\n同じこと考えるもんだな。なんか変な感じ！", "zh": "话说回来……大家居然一起带了零食来，\n想的都是同一件事，还真是奇怪的感觉！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0267_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_03_1019_013hib", "source_sha256": "a917395c87b43dedb4bcff69ffed830807397c184fa834d4294a6e8226cfc185", "ja": "あははっ、そうだね！\nでも自分達、それだけ息がピッタリってことじゃない？", "zh": "啊哈哈，说得也是！\n不过，这不正说明我们默契十足吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0267_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_03_1020_047sub", "source_sha256": "de1f433c8134faa17ed86c801a6ca1e8222d364a9e1ad3e5a4187733fdb47f9c", "ja": "それもそっか！　へへっ♪\nなんか今なら、ダンスもピッタリ合わせられそう？", "zh": "这样啊！嘿嘿♪\n总觉得现在的话，连舞蹈也能配合得天衣无缝？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0267_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_03_1021_019min", "source_sha256": "68793d7873c69c824d80d6ee205daf18f57eb623500ac0ef89bdc643df3d57fc", "ja": "うんうん！　カロリー補給したら、\nもうちょっと自主練、いっとこっか！", "zh": "嗯嗯！补充完热量后，\n再来稍微自主练习一会儿吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0267_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_03_1022_p", "source_sha256": "cde2128daa2d7f4b62fbb727b9c724768be346cad1cd9d532722aaf2dfd9b4e0", "ja": "（衣装のサイズが……とか、水を差すべきじゃないな。\n今は思いっきり楽しんでくれ。信頼してるぞ！）", "zh": "（服装尺寸什么的……现在还是别扫兴了。现在就尽情享受吧。我相信你！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
